OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss cancels 'ridiculous'
OL,4,Atheatre tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn under-fire police commissioner said
OL,7,Fhe had cancelled heavily criticised
OL,8,Fplans to take part in a 127-date
OL,9,Fnational theatre tour.
OL,11,FOpposition parties had questioned how
OL,12,FReform UK's Colin Sutton would be able
OL,13,Fto oversee Norfolk Police while also
OL,14,Fpresenting a live true crime stage show
OL,15,Facross the UK.
OL,17,FSutton told a council meeting that the
OL,18,Fnumber of dates was "ridiculous" and
OL,19,Fthat he had pulled out of the "Makings
OL,20,Fof a Murderer" tour after being
OL,21,Fcontacted by residents.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
