OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss cancels 'ridiculous'
OL,4,Atheatre tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative Matthew Taylor, who stood
OL,7,Fagainst Sutton in the police and crime
OL,8,Fcommissioner election in July, said it
OL,9,Fhad been "a sorry saga".
